sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Player
  participant S as Stack menu / Topic
  participant M as Material recipe generation
  participant R as Map research and recipe data
  participant P as produce_recipe
  participant D as do_after
  participant W as World objects
  U->>S: attack_self / list_recipes
  S->>M: obtain applicable recipes
  M->>R: faction/race, era, node or legacy thresholds
  R-->>M: allowed records
  M-->>S: stack_recipe datums with dynamic result_type
  U->>S: make + sublist + multiplier
  S->>S: restrained/stat/active-hand and multiplier gates
  S->>P: set can_build_recipe FALSE; produce_recipe
  P->>P: content-specific eligibility, prompts, inputs
  opt timed recipe
    P->>D: adjusted duration, actor state
    loop cooperative waits
      D->>D: actor, hand, movement, target revalidation
    end
    D-->>P: success or cancellation
  end
  alt cancelled or failed revalidation
    P-->>S: branch-specific cleanup/return
  else admitted commit
    P->>P: revalidate special inputs / source ownership
    P->>S: use(required, actor)
    opt wood-handle recipe and successful main debit
      P->>P: remove exact handle from its slot; qdel
    end
    P->>W: new recipe.result_type; apply branch-specific configuration
  end
  P-->>S: return; release can_build_recipe
  Note over P,W: This is a transaction skeleton. Payment order, prompts and cancellation vary by recipe branch.
